    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_e16530aac07a48e9ce3e4daacfe40f06b0f788d01245d49adbcd2857a0f33ca5",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "Reciprocal-power zero sums sigma connect global zero geometry to local coefficients of log xi, the exact eta-sigma identity separates those moments into eta data and an explicit zeta tail, and a binomial transform then connects sigma to Li coefficients; aggregate eta identities and first-zero scale arguments probe, but do not complete, this route.",
